        </h2>
        <p class="text-dg-muted text-base mb-12">One command. Every platform. Authenticate once, then go.</p>

        <!-- tabs -->
        <div class="inline-flex gap-1 p-1 rounded-2xl mb-5" style="background:#0b0b0c; border: 1px solid #2c2c33;">
          <button class="install-tab px-4 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold transition-all duration-150 bg-dg-charcoal text-dg-text shadow-sm"
